* `Workspace.Types.Core` — `IsPathList`, `IsPathFrom`, `IsAntipathFrom`,
  `pathLength`, `SPGT.interior`, `VertexComplete`, `EdgeComplete`, `Complete`,
  `ConnectedSet`, `AnticonnectedSet`;
* `Workspace.Types.Tracks` — `IsTrackList` (§5's *track*: a **subgraph**, not
